<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Mis Tareas</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
    
    <h1>Tareas de mis materias</h1>
    <p>Alumno: {{username}} | <a href="/student/dashboard">Volver al Tablero</a></p>
    
    {{#successMessage}}
    <div style="background-color: #ccffcc; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid green; margin-bottom: 15px; color: green; border-radius: 4px;"><b>Éxito:</b> {{successMessage}}</div>
    {{/successMessage}}
    {{#errorMessage}}
    <div style="background-color: #ffcccc; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid red; margin-bottom: 15px; color: red; border-radius: 4px;"><b>Error:</b> {{errorMessage}}</div>
    {{/errorMessage}}
    
    <hr>
    
    {{#tasks}}
    <div style="position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 15px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 15px; 
            {{#is_expired}}background-color: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;{{/is_expired}}
            {{^is_expired}}
                {{#is_ending_soon}}background-color: #fff3cd; color: #856404; border: 1px solid #ffeeba;{{/is_ending_soon}}
                {{^is_ending_soon}}background-color: #d1ecf1; color: #0c5460; border: 1px solid #bee5eb;{{/is_ending_soon}}
            {{/is_expired}}">
            
            🕒 Vence: {{formatted_due_date}}
            
            {{^is_expired}}
                {{#time_remaining_str}}<br>⏳ {{time_remaining_str}}{{/time_remaining_str}}
            {{/is_expired}}
    </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333;">📌 {{title}}</h3>
        <p style="white-space: pre-wrap;">{{description}}</p>
        
        {{#file_path}}
        <p><b>📄 Documento de la cátedra:</b> <a href="/{{file_path}}" target="_blank" style="color: #0056b3; font-weight: bold;">Descargar Archivo</a></p>
        {{/file_path}}
        
        <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px dashed #ccc; margin: 15px 0;">
        
        {{#submitted}}
            <p style="color: green; font-weight: bold;">Entregado ✅ - <a href="/{{submission_path}}" target="_blank" style="color: #28a745; text-decoration: underline;">Ver mi archivo entregado</a></p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; padding: 12px; background-color: #f4fbf7; border-left: 4px solid #28a745; border-radius: 4px;">
              {{#grade}}
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;"><strong>Calificación Asignada:</strong> <span style="background-color: #28a745; color: white; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: bold;">{{grade}}</span></p>
              {{/grade}}
              {{^grade}}
                <p style="margin: 2px 0; color: #666; font-style: italic;">Estado: Pendiente de corrección por el docente ⏳</p>
              {{/grade}}
              
              {{#comment}}
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 4px 0;"><strong>Comentario del profesor:</strong></p>
                <blockquote style="margin: 0; padding: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #ccc; font-style: italic; border-radius: 4px; color: #444;">"{{comment}}"</blockquote>
              {{/comment}}
            </div>
        {{/submitted}}

        {{^is_expired}}
            <form method="post" action="/student/tasks/{{id}}/submit" enctype="multipart/form-data" style="background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 15px;">
                <label style="font-weight: bold; color: #333;">
                    {{#submitted}}Sustituir entrega actual (PDF, DOCX, ZIP):{{/submitted}}
                    {{^submitted}}Subir mi resolución (PDF, DOCX, ZIP):{{/submitted}}
                </label><br>
                <input type="file" name="file" required style="margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><br>
                <button type="submit" style="padding: 8px 16px; background-color: {{#submitted}}#ffc107{{/submitted}}{{^submitted}}#28a745{{/submitted}}; color: {{#submitted}}#000{{/submitted}}{{^submitted}}#fff{{/submitted}}; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;">
                    {{#submitted}}🔄 Re-entregar Archivo{{/submitted}}
                    {{^submitted}}📤 Confirmar Entrega{{/submitted}}
                </button>
            </form>
        {{/is_expired}}

        {{#is_expired}}
            <div style="background-color: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; text-align: center; margin-top: 15px;">
                <b>🔒 La fecha límite para esta tarea ha expirado. Ya no se admiten entregas ni modificaciones.</b>
            </div>
        {{/is_expired}}
    </div>
    {{/tasks}}
    
    {{^tasks}}
    <div style="padding: 30px; text-align: center; border: 2px dashed #ccc; border-radius: 8px; background-color: #fdfdfd;">
        <p style="color: #777; font-size: 16px;"><i>No tienes tareas asignadas en tus cursadas actuales.</i></p>
    </div>
    {{/tasks}}

</body>
</html>